OL,3,GNEWSACompany to pay over #500,000 after
OL,4,Aworkers burned
OL,5,
OL,6,FA leading food manufacturer has been
OL,7,Ffined #594,000 after a man was left
OL,8,Fwith second-degree burns whilst
OL,9,Fconducting maintenance work at a
OL,10,Ffactory.
OL,12,FTwo men were working in the boiler room
OL,13,Fat the Samworth Brothers Ltd, operated
OL,14,FKettleby Foods factory, near Melton
OL,15,FMowbray, when they were both splashed
OL,16,Fwith hot water from pipework they were
OL,17,Frepairing.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
