OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSACompany to pay over #500,000 after
OL,4,Aworkers burned
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation by the Health and
OL,7,FSafety Executive found that the company
OL,8,Ffailed to risk assess the task and to
OL,9,F"document a safe system of work" for
OL,10,Fthe repairs.
OL,12,FSamworth Brothers Ltd was fined at
OL,13,FBirmingham Magistrates' Court on 4
OL,14,FSeptember after pleading guilty to
OL,15,Fbreaching the Health and Safety at Work
OL,16,FAct 1974 in June this year.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
